            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Input picker name is slow. It would be better to open a picker for selecting from registry and retain the previous query.\r\n\r\nThis can also be achieved because registry is available to the user. I'd suggest either using `MiniPick.ui_select()` to get the registry entry name or supply `completion` to ` vim.fn.input()`.",
